    "detailed_description": "Short Hop Laser is a Classic arcade 2d shooter with a twist! The only options your character has outside of horizontal movement is to 'short hop' and 'laser'.  Hone your Short Hop Laser skills in training mode and then try to get a high score by surviving as long as long as you can!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful,  shooting a laser while standing on the ground will have a longer animation than firing in the air. So be quick! Be accurate! and don't forget to fast fall!",
